data: {"result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"data\": {\n    \"lookupStatus\": \"found\",\n    \"comments\": [\n      {\n        \"id\": \"Y29tbWVudDo3NzcxNTE1OTUzMDI4ODZfNzc3ODE2MzI1MjM2NDEz\",\n        \"text\": \"Think about dating. If someone is interested in you, they will make the effort to see you. You have the coach and head coach, and if you're not getting a response, move on. Go where they want you and where you'll be appreciated. If they act like this now, imagine your kid being ignored when swimming for them.\",\n        \"createdAt\": \"2025-10-02T18:41:09.000Z\",\n        \"replyCount\": 0,\n        \"reactionCount\": 2,\n        \"repliesCursor\": \"\",\n        \"author\": {\n          \"name\": \"Nada De Nada\",\n          \"platformUserId\": \"pfbid02a6MoefS58yTLdqRtpGuqL19ftBhizzskjgqer2sEC8vhodt8S4MTLFhNyiF5Lvh2l\",\n          \"shortName\": \"Nada De\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"Y29tbWVudDo3NzcxNTE1OTUzMDI4ODZfNzc3NjM0OTExOTIxMjIx\",\n        \"text\": \"I would start letting go and spend your energy other places where the swimmer is wanted. We are just finishing up the process, son committed and he stopped emailing and communicating with coaches and schools that did not respond. He learned quickly where he was really wanted or not wanted. He talked to coaches from D1/P4(were he committed) to  many D2 Programs since June 15th...\",\n        \"createdAt\": \"2025-10-02T14:19:08.000Z\",\n        \"replyCount\": 1,\n        \"reactionCount\": 4,\n        \"repliesCursor\": \"\",\n        \"author\": {\n          \"name\": \"AnonymousMom2027\",\n          \"platformUserId\": \"4326440570918010\",\n          \"shortName\": null\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"Y29tbWVudDo3NzcxNTE1OTUzMDI4ODZfNzc3NjM4OTMxOTIwODE5\",\n        \"text\": \"Many D2s are probably still focused on 2026s at this point. Something that worked for us was to schedule the visit and then reach out to Admissions and tell them your student is interested in swimming and would love to meet the coach and see the pool if possible. They will likely be willing to reach out to the coach to try to get something set up for you.\",\n        \"createdAt\": \"2025-10-02T14:24:30.000Z\",\n        \"replyCount\": 3,\n        \"reactionCount\": 7,\n        \"repliesCursor\": \"\",\n        \"author\": {\n          \"name\": \"Brian Emanuel\",\n          \"platformUserId\": \"pfbid0LULMunaak6S8p3oXuVvmaapTyA9V4EKHichuM4kLT5XhwLN4abYwvB1MmK5AvYFPl\",\n          \"shortName\": \"Brian\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"Y29tbWVudDo3NzcxNTE1OTUzMDI4ODZfNzc3Njc3ODkxOTE2OTIz\",\n        \"text\": \"Don’t give up!\\nYou’re still early for a 2027.  It’s highly likely a D2 school is still focused on 2026 recruiting right now. (And definitely in summer when u started this).  My daughter was a 2025 who just started at a D2 in Florida.  For her - recruiting for d2/d3 picked up speed late spring of junior year.  She talked with schools all summer after junior year.  Did recruiting  trips in Sept/Oct Senior year.  Committed/signed after that. \\n\\nAlso - if u really like this school/team, I would still do the visit!  And just stop by the pool to see if you can say hi. That shows initiative.  One my my daughter’s final-four schools where she did an OV resulted from a random drive-through the school where she walked into the pool and met the coach.  Good luck\",\n        \"createdAt\": \"2025-10-02T15:18:00.000Z\",\n        \"replyCount\": 0,\n        \"reactionCount\": 4,\n        \"repliesCursor\": \"\",\n        \"author\": {\n          \"name\": \"Dave Bell\",\n          \"platformUserId\": \"pfbid02GBDzq3VPru3jRk1AhprS7hzo6KRNRUWQaWiL3amCozKbhcS4LjXKvNZyb1Move4pl\",\n          \"shortName\": \"Dave\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"Y29tbWVudDo3NzcxNTE1OTUzMDI4ODZfNzc3NzI4Nzk1MjQ1MTY2\",\n        \"text\": \"My daughter had to reach out 4 times before she got a response from her top choice school. Finally she wrote an email that said we will be in the area on these dates and I would love to meet you. She got a response right away and was shocked that the coach gave her 2 hours of her time!\",\n        \"createdAt\": \"2025-10-02T16:27:44.000Z\",\n        \"replyCount\": 0,\n        \"reactionCount\": 0,\n        \"repliesCursor\": \"\",\n        \"author\": {\n          \"name\": \"Anonymous participant 533\",\n          \"platformUserId\": \"1718741588789416\",\n          \"shortName\": null\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"Y29tbWVudDo3NzcxNTE1OTUzMDI4ODZfNzc3NjUyNzAxOTE5NDQy\",\n        \"text\": \"Many programs have tons of ‘26 recruits on visits currently so I’m guessing they are short on time. My daughter’s team is hosting 7 recruits this weekend as they still filling their roster for next year. Although it’s stressful stick with it-the timeline is fluid. Good luck! 🍀\",\n        \"createdAt\": \"2025-10-02T14:43:21.000Z\",\n        \"replyCount\": 0,\n        \"reactionCount\": 2,\n        \"repliesCursor\": \"\",\n        \"author\": {\n          \"name\": \"Colleen Lai Taylor\",\n          \"platformUserId\": \"pfbid023bbKkFkDGHDy4Nc49j99FjPzkWuES2svif92mDNyo6fogdh4SZo6Fbk4rSrWyAXSl\",\n          \"shortName\": \"Colleen\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"Y29tbWVudDo3NzcxNTE1OTUzMDI4ODZfNzc3NjY2OTY4NTg0Njgy\",\n        \"text\": \"Until you get a response, I would keep reaching out.  The coaching side of the brain is the opposite side of recruiting. Until you hear no, I would keep trying!  If you have videos, I would send those.  It's really hard not to take it personally but a lot of times Coaches are really good coaches and people but they are not as comfortable recruiting.\\nI would encourage your child to go after what they want with everything they have and no matter the outcome, they have no regrets!!\",\n        \"createdAt\": \"2025-10-02T15:03:48.000Z\",\n        \"replyCount\": 0,\n        \"reactionCount\": 0,\n        \"repliesCursor\": \"\",\n        \"author\": {\n          \"name\": \"Keri Seeliger Buff\",\n          \"platformUserId\": \"pfbid02THTMzafvK4zBHvRvKm2gXD1zJofdjz1UKt3CqCDUMPgs3t15L6KvxtaMJRBaarDUl\",\n          \"shortName\": \"Keri\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"Y29tbWVudDo3NzcxNTE1OTUzMDI4ODZfNzgxNjc0ODk4MTgzODg5\",\n        \"text\": \"That happened to my daughter but only over the course of 2-3 months maybe and she emailed 3 times with no response.  But she fit perfectly so we sent another email and made it catchy “the squeaky wheels gets the grease they say…” meaning she’s not going away and that email worked. Turns out it was bc of summer vacation and coaches daughter was having a baby etc etc. Life basically! It also helped that we had decided to do an unofficial visit to that school and others in the state so we gave specific dates and asked if we could met them. Yes they said depending on the timing of the new baby. It all worked out and now my daughter is swimming as a freshman at this D1 school. So don’t give up if you really really feel it’s a great fit on pretty much all levels. We had a lot of levels to deal with bc my daughter is studying nursing and a lot of college swim teams don’t accept that field of study very nicely bc nursing is extremely time consuming but this school was ok with it.\",\n        \"createdAt\": \"2025-10-07T03:27:59.000Z\",\n        \"replyCount\": 0,\n        \"reactionCount\": 0,\n        \"repliesCursor\": \"\",\n        \"author\": {\n          \"name\": \"Rita Kellogg\",\n          \"platformUserId\": \"pfbid02SNAHBgMuGdLc4oKk51kYAaLRHhiopuedDt7pddsogp3mhBqd21c3XmRJ6NaWGXe3l\",\n          \"shortName\": \"Rita\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"Y29tbWVudDo3NzcxNTE1OTUzMDI4ODZfNzc3NjUyNjcxOTE5NDQ1\",\n        \"text\": \"Sometimes, coaches are just busy. If it's really a top choice, I'd keep at it until you commit somewhere else. My daughter swims D2 and loves it!\",\n        \"createdAt\": \"2025-10-02T14:43:17.000Z\",\n        \"replyCount\": 1,\n        \"reactionCount\": 2,\n        \"repliesCursor\": \"\",\n        \"author\": {\n          \"name\": \"LaRonda Gumm\",\n          \"platformUserId\": \"pfbid0hHm8CUvroGT2bJ7yhYHeEJbUNacA5wFF38B9g4p9XdBWMxeFMxBx7zjnvHNeU22al\",\n          \"shortName\": \"LaRonda\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"Y29tbWVudDo3NzcxNTE1OTUzMDI4ODZfNzc3NjcxODExOTE3NTMx\",\n        \"text\": \"I’ve found the D2s never email back—we’ve had more D1s respond than D2s. Pretty much 1 D2 responded. Makes me wonder if they’re recruiting from portal. It’s weird.\",\n        \"createdAt\": \"2025-10-02T15:09:41.000Z\",\n        \"replyCount\": 0,\n        \"reactionCount\": 0,\n        \"repliesCursor\": \"\",\n        \"author\": {\n          \"name\": \"Marie Kopinski\",\n          \"platformUserId\": \"pfbid02TH8MqyQbXbtEivhyUgSrMEH7Rkb1WZfUy1PxJPB7B3UK4aKrbk77LMHAksHGcvYAl\",\n          \"shortName\": \"Marie\"\n        }\n      }\n    ],\n    \"page\": {\n      \"nextCursor\": \"MToxNzkzOTg0NTczOgF_T6SFD9oi8P230MTkeutWDraIQ8db2FAShOnvSLGvkV4lWAwEsOCjnz5n9GY9UNLoKDIkcYEjhOZgwRcFSHTljF8yGTaDFwBB7F31ugKUQ9zm0ZkRjKjORzcm0fYQvBu4xBgQXOrjTei0giVOo5yEHckO_iRsOiP342rsTnlSf8QWJcASTa2K5PJ4nullCibgWqL6aE9sy37iM1yUoxfdagzD85PIIKr4J03u33HIrwCm2Hjocy6pacyfA8ozLjccGm2srF6ed9dCzMXwidGkT401jXvdVc2P-b154D_plroziuT6gitpoQiNNVttT1Cq07tI8-IH_AgT9UmAvKnH6x4qRC9ICx_8mHS14bMyP6sBn9IlyCclCqMQ2tTD44y2udqEXFnjcK8xtmAW1zzCk08JC1kfC067aYBNo1jpTCY78Gwtt1PBZr8\",\n      \"hasMore\": true\n    }\n  },\n  \"meta\": {\n    \"requestId\": \"req_b7a81507-c1b6-4e7e-9b56-920e6c3f4410\",\n    \"creditsCharged\": 1,\n    \"version\": \"v1\"\n  }\n}"},{"type":"text","text":"{\"conversation_id\":\"01a1b1d0-1a7f-78e8-9575-f833b02016db\"}"}],"structuredContent":{"data":{"lookupStatus":"found","comments":[{"id":"Y29tbWVudDo3NzcxNTE1OTUzMDI4ODZfNzc3ODE2MzI1MjM2NDEz","text":"Think about dating. If someone is interested in you, they